 Photo: Ena Suto/ABC News via White House pool ✈️ New photos are emerging from President Trump's flight out of Turkey last month, when he reportedly used a catering container to secretly switch planes to dodge an Iranian threat. The smaller plane Trump is said to have boarded , an Air Force C-32A, is seen here behind the Boeing 747 that's been the traditional presidential plane. That plane flew on, with reporters thinking Trump was aboard. Get the latest . 📱 New York Post Media Group is launching a custom AI chatbot as part of a broader AI-powered personalized news experience called Hamilton. More from Sara Fischer . 🎧 YouTube sensation Ms. Rachel and her husband are releasing their debut album, "I'm So Happy," on Sept. 25. She tells AP: "Music is such a wonderful way for people to bond, for parents to bond." Go deeper . 
 
