 4. 🎮 1 for the road: Madden meets AI 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 A screengrab from franchise mode. Photo: EA Madden NFL 27's refreshed franchise mode features AI-generated breaking news, headlines and media narratives, Axios' Herb Scribner reports. 

 Instead of selecting a task like "pick your rookie class," players will open up a generated article titled: "Which rookies will we see in the NFL draft?" 🏈 A "news center" shows gamers what's happening around the league.

 During the offseason, players will enter a "free agent frenzy" mini-game with breaking news alerts from ESPN. Go deeper . 

 
 
